{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "140d2f689223caab5ed5637d284032e718a38f53b31fbf743394723654a7bf53", "ja": "未来VS千鶴", "zh": "未来VS千鹤", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6d96c449b5b5ea50fa77341007f6084bfe87ac631fffa14e395519cae81c09f1", "ja": "いよいよ、未来と千鶴のコロッケ当て対決！\n仲間が見守るなか、未来と千鶴の答えが\n別れてしまう。真剣勝負を終え、相手を称え\nあうアイドルを見て、プロデューサーは\nBOT最後の公演のテーマを閃くのだった。", "zh": "未来与千鹤的可乐饼竞猜对决终于开始！\n在同伴们的注视下，未来与千鹤给出了\n不同的答案。看着全力对决后互相称赞对方\n的偶像们，制作人灵光一闪，\n想到了BOT最后公演的主题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fc9e96bac1b7cdb886f83f36bf3ac3b22d7d9ddb49d72e58d3f85815a497a46c", "ja": "（今日は千鶴さんと未来の『ズバリとセレブ！』対決！\n題材はもちろん……コロッケだ！）", "zh": "（今天是和千鹤小姐、未来一起参加的《精准判断，名流对决》！题目当然是……可乐饼！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "4a912985bd28846d4c895228546d2227bb9e9d454105ed52a2531970ab497c53", "ja": "（2人にはお求めやすい品と高級品、それぞれの\nコロッケを食べてもらったが……果たして！）", "zh": "（让2人分别品尝了平价款和高级款的可乐饼，不过……究竟会怎样呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "73e22a78cba65dc017796168ead66bb8a2ce118a62251d1e1406c524b043df98", "ja": "うう、どうしよう……。", "zh": "呜呜，怎么办啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "2c4d027e3cfb48bcfb5f8521cb48b3d70fb6edd184e01322f195250f2984d7a0", "ja": "未来さん、がんばって！\nおいもの味はきっと違いがあるはずだべさ！", "zh": "未来，加油！\n土豆的味道肯定会有区别的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "17bbf6f7ff0ec1bdc9721d164b7bed5db38a4102b6535c2938cbbf6985d0a124", "ja": "違いは、ある……！\nそれはわかるんだけど……！", "zh": "是有区别……！\n这一点我知道，可是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "3f94b4a4fc0bfd2136745cf582e35801e70894882e29827a9fdaade5439eb78e", "ja": "違いがわかるのかい？\nそれなら……！", "zh": "你能分辨出区别吗？那样的话……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "3ac98c8111c9b95248be57eade47cba7b1003e8fbd12c369f8caddd9446da577", "ja": "でも……どっちもおいしい！\nだから、すごく困ってる……！", "zh": "不过……两个都很好吃！\n所以，我特别为难……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "a05cbc793edb2576ba36d1233de4d8c346616fa863ff6bbb7a46a8ce240ac298", "ja": "この様子だと、未来は\n勘で答えることになりそうね。", "zh": "照这样下去，未来好像只能凭感觉回答了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_1008_052kao", "source_sha256": "ea9f649cb552159d36e03182736a590f06e1fbda16228c3ee188c89506f7e85f", "ja": "千鶴ちゃん、どう？　調理されたものだと\n判断も難しい気がするけど……。", "zh": "千鹤，你觉得呢？如果是烹饪好的食物，感觉也很难判断……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_1010_038chz", "source_sha256": "dcb46342e54bf326d601b0a2601d6264629cf08d3713fdd2d38c699181eff3c9", "ja": "回答は、決まりましたわ。\nこちらで間違いないと思います。", "zh": "我已经决定好答案了。\n我想肯定是这个没错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "6dcb188d1aecf3445c9e92460cd086ffe3592d7af90fba51dc384a366af4ab2b", "ja": "すごい自信……！　さすがはセレブ～♪\n高級品だって、難なく～♪", "zh": "好有自信……！不愧是名媛～♪\n就连高级货，也能轻松分辨～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_1012_p", "source_sha256": "6b7483dc90e2fa5f408683fc97f459b8bc861f27b7fad508f7b6da57c7f886d2", "ja": "そろそろ回答といこうか。\nAとB、高級品はどちらのコロッケか……ズバリ！？", "zh": "差不多该揭晓答案了。\nA和B，究竟哪一边的可乐饼是高级品……答案是！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "888318da6877694e32e4ac264361c60c23956981f51cdb1e696c94b40c99ce6b", "ja": "Aです！／Bですわ！", "zh": "选A！／选B！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_1014_038chz", "source_sha256": "6365b9cafeaaa1808878fdfeb5d70559340be26c1cc6d1aa0edf4bd22ec0ab8a", "ja": "Bですわ！", "zh": "是B哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_1015_p", "source_sha256": "432848fd492c6d9c8bcd9d90908a647d96b4fe2a91aa315d9159d012bbd6d518", "ja": "未来がA、千鶴さんがBだな。\n正解は……B！　千鶴さんの勝利だ！", "zh": "未来是A，千鹤是B。\n答案是……B！千鹤获胜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "f1d015c7e20f8daf540f45f4a551efa03cb1e71071aba2d495d8f01cdfcf64ac", "ja": "おおー！", "zh": "喔喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_1017_033sih", "source_sha256": "90b8fbb716d99fab8134ddbd0d1f951f19992cf529640e04719620c54365bdcf", "ja": "へえ……！", "zh": "哦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "d233ff3d7c2f09661fe2a87454a2e9fd2f4d9d610027448bc2efba361accc17d", "ja": "わあ……！", "zh": "哇啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_1019_052kao", "source_sha256": "fe8b1491c2555d68b34ecf77be7da69bcdcedf741ca1e5dce549b208730141cb", "ja": "まあ……！", "zh": "哎呀……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_1020_033sih", "source_sha256": "e8902754e39c23d086abdae293bcadf1fe1e823d2804da836642e242a94bcae8", "ja": "千鶴さん、ほとんど迷わなかったですね。\n味に差があったんですか？", "zh": "千鹤，你几乎没怎么犹豫呢。\n是味道上有什么不同吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_1021_038chz", "source_sha256": "649848da90d18d6fbe32526a86d69c70ddb92868dd7f59e2942e3fa3d422dc0d", "ja": "ええ。Bからはひき肉の臭み消し、クローブが\n香りましたわ。Aからはお醤油の下味が。", "zh": "是的。从B中闻到了去除肉馅腥味的丁香香气。从A中闻到了酱油腌制的底味。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_1022_038chz", "source_sha256": "4bb53cd6adfceef5f4b653e8e7cdb9d28ecc5d330b691daea26c716e5938d30d", "ja": "ソースをかけず、買い食いでもおいしく\nいただくための工夫なのではと。", "zh": "我想，这大概是为了不浇酱汁，直接买来吃也能美味享用而下的功夫吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_1023_035hin", "source_sha256": "f85d496276f020c5afcfa4c86fb5445df68efc4ef87c0f276b21acef4b03596f", "ja": "たいしたもんだねぇ……。お求めやすい品も\nそんなに分析できちゃうなんて……。", "zh": "真厉害啊……连价格亲民的商品都能分析得这么透彻……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_1024_038chz", "source_sha256": "ba0a87a27b825309d1a2cae4c287f349404a3af3508365db02643077517f1fb6", "ja": "それは我が家……ではなく！　うちのシェフから\nそういう作り方もあると聞いたことがあって。", "zh": "那是我家……不对！是听我家的主厨说过，还有那样的制作方法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_1025_038chz", "source_sha256": "7412ebc80c64986b44c3984c40600e35f6e3865cba32b84b1a00a0b0f8926ae3", "ja": "うちでも試したことはありますのよ？\nカジュアルなコロッケも美味だと思いますわ。", "zh": "我们家也是尝试过的哦？\n休闲风的可乐饼也是很美味的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_1026_052kao", "source_sha256": "6f82d8f6691855b59a4cc49aa4e3f63f61ddcbc3c602a6d5d45bf49e8c33cb15", "ja": "未来ちゃん、惜しかったわね。味の違いは\nわかってたから、本当にあと一歩の差で。", "zh": "未来，真可惜啊。你已经尝出味道的不同了，真的就只差一步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_1027_036kan", "source_sha256": "4f17b4ad8cc827da5fb5a015d70a5c30a38c43f091c3d201e0dc6e8a7d388f9e", "ja": "落ち込まないで！　私もきっと両方おいしいって\n言っちゃうと思うから……えへへ♪", "zh": "别灰心！我觉得我肯定也会说两个都好吃的……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_1028_014mir", "source_sha256": "c5c81f671867d49a7db7bdb36b66b0d9e08c502aa8cd80b6cd3f3d38c7ed8f46", "ja": "ありがとう。完敗だけど……でも、\n千鶴さんの真剣な表情を見れて、嬉しかったです！", "zh": "谢谢。虽然输得心服口服……不过，能看到千鹤小姐认真的表情，我很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_1029_038chz", "source_sha256": "876ddab9ad1c63eabd2bfd51a096c795334fd9e3dae5cd1e06a73e99608b45a3", "ja": "それはもう。\n勝負となれば当然本気ですわ。", "zh": "那是当然的。\n既然是比赛，我当然会认真应战。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_1030_014mir", "source_sha256": "f38247c580cde18328767ef0b779c6387127b01033b19d443404d9075d47a1cd", "ja": "これからももっともーっと、\n千鶴さんのこと知りたくなりました！", "zh": "今后，我想更多更多地了解千鹤小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_1031_014mir", "source_sha256": "d89027e76f6ce0bb1415cbe32dab84640865012c2a63951a048bd5edf81a2417", "ja": "また勝負しましょうね！　千鶴さん！", "zh": "下次再一决胜负吧！千鹤小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_1032_038chz", "source_sha256": "5c8002898e46f5c78fe385751cd2aa8380223ff3e64e0f056d3fabf6bd62ed8f", "ja": "ええ！\n再挑戦はいつでも受け付けますわ。", "zh": "是的！\n随时欢迎再来挑战。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_1033_p", "source_sha256": "3db977219bd45833d2ba8165caa6042d793d6614aa99e7ad4e0afb0aa29b3e08", "ja": "また勝負を、いつでも……。\nうん、そうだな。ふたりの言う通りだ。", "zh": "下次再比一场，随时都可以……  \n嗯，没错。就像你们两个说的那样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_06_1034_p", "source_sha256": "6176a20fac475f12d4faedf00b426bbc076f338eaad3d0010c0d8aa3ea4c0e61", "ja": "未来、千鶴さん。ありがとう、\nお陰で今回の公演の方向性が決まりました。", "zh": "未来、千鹤，谢谢你们。\n多亏了你们，这次公演的方向定下来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
